tree: traffic-and-dragons-next-ten-ending
--- A. a name written as a one-element list (not a string, so not checked; String([w]) is w)
!! npcUpdates name=[__proto__]
      in : {"chapterSummary":"A day passes.","npcUpdates":[{"name":["__proto__"],"attitude":"wary","knowledgeGained":"a fact"}]}
      #540 drops said on the console: 0 | Bram knows: ["keeps the forge"] | Bram attitude: "" | lore: [] | npc keys: ["Bram","Kira","Old Ned","__proto__"]
      state: own key '__proto__' at mem.npcs
!! npcDeaths name=[__proto__]
      in : {"chapterSummary":"A day passes.","npcDeaths":[{"name":["__proto__"],"handle":"h1","sourceTurn":5}]}
      #540 drops said on the console: 0 | Bram knows: ["keeps the forge"] | Bram attitude: "" | lore: [] | npc keys: ["Bram","Kira","Old Ned"]
      applySummaryExtract THREW: W2 referential integrity: __proto__ - summary death lacks matching scene-handle evidence
