--- C. keys of the extraction JSON itself
   top-level key __proto__ (JSON.parse makes it an own key)
      in : {"chapterSummary":"A day passes.","__proto__":{"npcUpdates":[{"name":"Bram","attitude":"dead"}]},"npcUpdates":[{"name":"Bram","knowledgeGained":"shod the grey mare"}]}
      #540 drops said on the console: 0 | Bram knows: ["keeps the forge","shod the grey mare"] | Bram attitude: "" | lore: [] | npc keys: ["Bram","Kira","Old Ned"]
   entry key __proto__ inside an npcUpdates entry
      in : {"chapterSummary":"A day passes.","npcUpdates":[{"name":"Bram","knowledgeGained":"shod the grey mare","__proto__":{"name":"Old Ned"}}]}
      #540 drops said on the console: 0 | Bram knows: ["keeps the forge","shod the grey mare"] | Bram attitude: "" | lore: [] | npc keys: ["Bram","Kira","Old Ned"]
